            "notes": "[Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399) is the best power for round 1. 30% damage is a significant buff and will consistently get you kills. Try to always have the empowered swing ready when you start to attack someone. You can do this by swinging twice before you start the fight.\n[Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) are generally the best options.",
