            "notes": "[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is the best item and it is worth it to sell everything to get it. [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is decent but not as valuable as 3 common items. [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) is one of the four best common items for [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49). between these 5 items just try to utilize the most of your cash as possible.\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) can be bought if you have less than 10k cash.",
