            "notes": "[Blazing Blitz](item_6dd5ba0e-fe32-4128-9f34-4ce8619237b7) is the best power that Rein has. It has somehow flown under the radar as almost nobody will take it. [Blazing Blitz](item_6dd5ba0e-fe32-4128-9f34-4ce8619237b7) turns your ultimate from situationally useful to one of the best in the game. The reason for this is that 1 swing will do the normal swing damage as well as the firestrike damage. [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) will give you damage across the board as well as significant healing. any extra cash can be spent on any previous item mentioned.",
